SUMMARY:Mimosas and Contemporary Art Weekend!
DESCRIPTION:Come in for mimosas and snacks on Saturdays and Sundays at Jaime Byrd Contemporary Art gallery! From 11am-4pm we welcome you to join us in some art shopping and even lunch at our highly rated cafe/restaurant\, Piccolina\, at 375 Depot Street in the River Arts District of Asheville. \nJaime Byrd’s paintings will bring light\, color\, and calmness to any space in your home or office while creating pieces in a number of different LARGE and SMALL sizes for different needs. \nStep into a gallery unlike any other—where paintings don’t just hang on the wall\, they move\, breathe\, and tell stories. Renowned artist and Emmy nominated filmmaker\, Jaime Byrd\, invites you to experience her signature LARGE (and small) oil on wood paintings\, seamlessly merged with cinematic film\, ambient sound (all created by the artist). \nJaime’s work has been part of a collection at the Asheville Art Museum as well as public and private collections around the world. Jaime’s paintings can be seen in person at her open 2000 sq ft. gallery located in the River Arts District of Asheville\, NC. \n🎧 Immerse yourself in art you can hear. \n🎥 Watch paintings transform into short films. \n📲 Interactive tech meets timeless beauty. \n✨ Perfect for first-time visitors and returning fans alike. Come curious—leave inspired. \n📍Jaime Byrd Contemporary Art Gallery – 375 Depot Street\, SUITE 105\, Asheville\, NC.
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/mimosas-and-contemporary-art-weekend/2026-04-25/
LOCATION:Jaime Byrd Contemporary Art\, 375 Depot St. Suite 105\, Asheville\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Events,Second Saturday Art Strolls
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_4133.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Jaime Byrd":MAILTO:art@jaimebyrd.com
GEO:35.5814825;-82.5647072
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Jaime Byrd Contemporary Art 375 Depot St. Suite 105 Asheville 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=375 Depot St. Suite 105:geo:-82.5647072,35.5814825
END:VEVENT
