SUMMARY:Tasty Treats in the Flameshop
DESCRIPTION:Make your own mini glass snack food! In just 50 minutes your instructor will guide you through the basic soft glass torch skills needed to create a sweet memento of your own. Revel in the exhilaration of melting glass as you apply the colors of your choice and add sprinkles or icing\, sauce or cheese. \nSkill level: Beginner to Intermediate \nItems are ready to take home the next day. We can also ship for an additional fee.
