SUMMARY:Champagne + Shopping
DESCRIPTION:Unwind. Sip. Adorn. \nJoin us every Friday and Saturday from 5 to 7pm for our signature in-store ritual. \nChampagne + Shopping is a moment to pause\, to play\, and to discover. Whether you’re exploring fine jewelry\, finding your new must-have handbag\, or trying on a new fragrance\, you’ll be surrounded by warmth\, beauty\, and bubbles. \nNo appointment needed. Just bring your sparkle.
