SUMMARY:Beginning Marbling
DESCRIPTION:Experience the centuries old process of floating paint on a thick gel. Draw designs\, lay paper on it and voila\, the design is frozen!! \n​ \nClass participants will practice many different styles of patterns while learning a bit of history. Each practice paper moves you to confidence in working large on the final project- a cotton bandana or a square silk scarf.
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/beginning-marbling-2/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:Majik Studios 207\, 348 Depot Street\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Events
