SUMMARY:Beach Collage with Li Newton
DESCRIPTION:Palm trees\, crashing waves\, the roar of the ocean…heaven. This class will focus on depicting moving water\, cloudy skies and sandy beaches. Maybe even a sunset. \nLearn to paint with paper. We will all work from the same image.\nGoals:\n-Learn basic analog (cut by hand) paper collage techniques.\n-Basic cutting and gluing\, building layers to create depth.\n-Complete or build the foundation for a 9 X 12 finished piece. \nI will supply:\nwood panels\, many types and colors of paper\, scissors\, gel medium\, foam brush\, gloves. \nStudent supplies:\n-Any personal items such as photo (copies) or small personal items to attach.\n– Extra colorful papers\, magazines\, etc. that have a variety of colors and textures.\n– Apron or clothes you do mind getting a little glue on.\n– A beverage and snack. \nEveryone can do this! Don’t be intimidated. It’s all about learning\, experimenting\, and community. \nRegistration at https://www.tracksidestudios.com/classes
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/beach-collage-with-li-newton/
LOCATION:Trackside Studios\, 375 Depot Street\, Asheville\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Classes
